OL,3,GNEWSA'Hockney Country' wind turbine
OL,4,Aplans rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for six large wind turbines in
OL,7,Fthe Yorkshire Wolds have been rejected.
OL,9,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council has
OL,10,Frefused an application for the
OL,11,Fturbines, each reaching 488ft (149m)
OL,12,Fhigh, near Burton Agnes, over concerns
OL,13,Ffor the landscape and local residents.
OL,15,FCarol Bliss, a local artist and
OL,16,Fcampaigner against the plans, said:
OL,17,F"We're glad that common sense has been
OL,18,Fbrought to bear."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
